; caldera_cistern_bottom.room - the vault where the village cistern shaft (cols 48-51) lands (design 04 section 3.7).
; No gate: the dais under the shaft steps down to the floor west (crater) and east (temple gate).
; Stone ledges (rows 14, 10, 6, 2; 4 rows apart) zigzag from the dais up the shaft into village_cistern's ledges,
; so the Redoma route climbs back without wall climb (bugs/a-redoma-first-player-is-trapped-in-the-summer-caldera).

[room]
origin = 0, 0

